{"id":"B1-L088","title":"Integrated communication: Career","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U06","focus":"Comunicação integrada: Carreira","targets":{"grammar":"Comunicação integrada: Carreira","pron":"Sentence stress","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["university degree","practical course","trade school","apprentice job","study path","student debt","career choice","graduate job","skill gap","college tuition","hands-on training","job guarantee","young graduate","lecture course","vocational school","work placement","job prospects","degree holder"],"field":"Carreira","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Escuta","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 88 · Integrated communication: Career","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Comunicação integrada: Carreira.","**Pronúncia:** Sentence stress.","**18 palavras novas** (carreira).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo ler, ouvir, falar e escrever sobre carreira a partir de um editorial."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["university degree","diploma universitário"],["practical course","curso prático"],["trade school","escola técnica"],["apprentice job","trabalho de aprendiz"],["study path","caminho de estudo"],["student debt","dívida estudantil"],["career choice","escolha de carreira"],["graduate job","emprego para graduados"],["skill gap","lacuna de habilidades"],["college tuition","mensalidade da faculdade"],["hands-on training","treinamento prático"],["job guarantee","garantia de emprego"],["young graduate","jovem formado"],["lecture course","curso de palestras"],["vocational school","escola profissionalizante"],["work placement","estágio"],["job prospects","perspectivas de emprego"],["degree holder","portador de diploma"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Should Everyone Go to University?","paras":["Many young people **believe** a degree guarantees a good job. **In my opinion**, that is not always true. **On the one hand**, university teaches theory; **on the other hand**, apprentices learn by doing.","**If** more schools offered practical courses, fewer students **would** feel lost. **To sum up**, choose the path that fits you."],"kicker":"OPINION","by":"Careers Today","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The writer thinks a degree always guarantees a job.","ans":"F","why":"not always true."},{"q":"Apprentices learn by doing.","ans":"T","why":"learn by doing."},{"q":"The writer recommends one single path.","ans":"F","why":"fits you."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“degree” = ?","opts":["diploma universitário","grau só","dever"],"ans":0,"why":"degree."},{"q":"“apprentice” = ?","opts":["aprendiz","aprovado","apreciador"],"ans":0,"why":"apprentice."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Writing an opinion on careers","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Parte","Frases úteis"],"rows":[["posição","**In my opinion,…**"],["contraste","**On the one hand… on the other hand…**"],["hipótese","**If more schools offered…, fewer students would…**"],["conclusão","**To sum up,…**"]],"cap":"Writing an opinion on careers"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Editorial: **tese → dois lados → hipótese → conclusão**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"A degree ___ a job. (guarantee, 3ª)","a":"guarantees","why":"3ª pessoa."},{"s":"Apprentices learn ___ doing. (by)","a":"by","why":"by + -ing."},{"s":"If schools offered more, students ___ feel lost. (would)","a":"would","why":"2º cond."},{"s":"To ___ up, choose your path. (sum)","a":"sum","why":"conclusão."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["university degree","diploma universitário"],["practical course","curso prático"],["trade school","escola técnica"],["apprentice job","trabalho de aprendiz"],["study path","caminho de estudo"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["sum","up","choose","your","path","To"],"ans":"To sum up choose your path","pt":"Resumindo, escolha seu caminho."},{"words":["degree","guarantee","a","job","Does","a"],"ans":"Does a degree guarantee a job","pt":"Um diploma garante emprego?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"university degree","pos":"word","pt":"diploma universitário","ex":"University degree.","expt":"Diploma universitário."},{"w":"practical course","pos":"word","pt":"curso prático","ex":"Practical course.","expt":"Curso prático."},{"w":"trade school","pos":"word","pt":"escola técnica","ex":"Trade school.","expt":"Escola técnica."},{"w":"apprentice job","pos":"word","pt":"trabalho de aprendiz","ex":"Apprentice job.","expt":"Trabalho de aprendiz."},{"w":"study path","pos":"word","pt":"caminho de estudo","ex":"Study path.","expt":"Caminho de estudo."},{"w":"student debt","pos":"word","pt":"dívida estudantil","ex":"Student debt.","expt":"Dívida estudantil."},{"w":"career choice","pos":"word","pt":"escolha de carreira","ex":"Career choice.","expt":"Escolha de carreira."},{"w":"graduate job","pos":"word","pt":"emprego para graduados","ex":"Graduate job.","expt":"Emprego para graduados."},{"w":"skill gap","pos":"word","pt":"lacuna de habilidades","ex":"Skill gap.","expt":"Lacuna de habilidades."},{"w":"college tuition","pos":"word","pt":"mensalidade da faculdade","ex":"College tuition.","expt":"Mensalidade da faculdade."},{"w":"hands-on training","pos":"word","pt":"treinamento prático","ex":"Hands-on training.","expt":"Treinamento prático."},{"w":"job guarantee","pos":"word","pt":"garantia de emprego","ex":"Job guarantee.","expt":"Garantia de emprego."},{"w":"young graduate","pos":"word","pt":"jovem formado","ex":"Young graduate.","expt":"Jovem formado."},{"w":"lecture course","pos":"word","pt":"curso de palestras","ex":"Lecture course.","expt":"Curso de palestras."},{"w":"vocational school","pos":"word","pt":"escola profissionalizante","ex":"Vocational school.","expt":"Escola profissionalizante."},{"w":"work placement","pos":"word","pt":"estágio","ex":"Work placement.","expt":"Estágio."},{"w":"job prospects","pos":"word","pt":"perspectivas de emprego","ex":"Job prospects.","expt":"Perspectivas de emprego."},{"w":"degree holder","pos":"word","pt":"portador de diploma","ex":"Degree holder.","expt":"Portador de diploma."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Learn the ropes.** — Aprender o ofício.","**Get a foot in the door.** — Conseguir entrar.","**Climb the ladder.** — Subir na carreira.","**Does a degree guarantee a job?** — Um diploma garante emprego?","**Not always. Apprentices learn by doing.** — Nem sempre. Aprendizes aprendem fazendo.","**To sum up, choose your path.** — Resumindo, escolha seu caminho.","**Few and far between.** — Raros.","**Fit like a glove.** — Cair como uma luva."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"guarantee","pt":"garantir","forms":[["I / you / we / they guarantee","It guarantees success."],["he / she / it guarantees","Isso garante o sucesso."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Debate","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Debate","lines":[["Ana","Does a degree guarantee a job?","Um diploma garante emprego?"],["Leo","Not always. Apprentices learn by doing.","Nem sempre. Aprendizes aprendem fazendo."],["Ana","If schools offered practical courses, students would be happier.","Se as escolas oferecessem cursos práticos, os alunos seriam mais felizes."],["Leo","To sum up, choose your path.","Resumindo, escolha seu caminho."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Sentence stress","items":[{"label":"Sentence stress","note":"Na frase, acentue palavras de conteúdo (substantivos, verbos, adjetivos) e reduza as funcionais: I WANT to LEARN ENglish.","words":["I want to learn English.","She has studied for years.","Can you help me?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Give an opinion.","pt":"Opine.","model":"In my opinion, practice matters."},{"q":"Contrast two paths.","pt":"Contraste.","model":"On the one hand it’s safe; on the other it’s slow."},{"q":"Conclude.","pt":"Conclua.","model":"To sum up, choose what fits you."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-line editorial on university vs practical training.","model":"In my opinion, a degree is not always enough. On the one hand, university teaches theory. On the other hand, apprentices learn by doing. If more schools offered practical courses, fewer students would feel lost. To sum up, choose the path that fits you. What do you think?","checklist":["Usei **In my opinion**","Usei **On the one hand / other**","Usei **If + would**"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “university degree” mean?","opts":["diploma universitário","curso prático","trabalho de aprendiz"],"ans":0,"why":"**university degree** = diploma universitário."},{"q":"What does “practical course” mean?","opts":["escola técnica","curso prático","caminho de estudo"],"ans":1,"why":"**practical course** = curso prático."},{"q":"What does “trade school” mean?","opts":["trabalho de aprendiz","dívida estudantil","escola técnica"],"ans":2,"why":"**trade school** = escola técnica."},{"q":"What does “apprentice job” mean?","opts":["trabalho de a